# Local Vite dev only. Leave unset (or use the relative `/api/v1`) so the
# browser calls the same origin. Vite proxies `/api` to http://localhost:4000
# (see vite.config.ts). In the Vercel deployment this must stay unset so the
# SPA calls the backend through the same-origin /api/v1 rewrite.
#
# Only set an absolute URL if you intentionally bypass the proxy. The
# production CSP allows same-origin connections only.
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:4000/api/v1
